   4:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h **** /** Some notes as I set stuff up:
   5:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  
   6:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  The HAL_TIM_Base_Init() seems to cover everything we need, 
   7:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  everything for the "channel" I/O happens via the MspInit HAL callbacks
   8:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  Since we'll be handling these post-init, on channel-by-channel option
   9:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  we can probably avoid doing the {function}Init stuff, and populating any MspInit
  10:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  
  11:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  Also, I'm including all of the modes here for now, but I'm really focused on 
  12:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  implementing PWM (via DMA). So I will do all of the implementation for that, 
  13:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  and then see what doing IC, OC, and ONEPULSE would look like.
  14:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  * 
  15:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  *  also we'll _probably_ have to do a pimpl, but we'll see what we can do without one for the mome
  16:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  * 
  17:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/per/tim_channel.h ****  */
