 229:temp_led_stuff.h ****     /** Self-healing for the SMT<->PTH DMA chain: if no handoff has happened
 230:temp_led_stuff.h ****      *  for ~200 ms the chain is dead (LEDs frozen) -> restart it. Call from
 231:temp_led_stuff.h ****      *  the main loop. A3: two consecutive stale checks before acting, and
 232:temp_led_stuff.h ****      *  the restart runs with only the LED DMA IRQ (DMA2_Stream5) masked -
 233:temp_led_stuff.h ****      *  never global IRQs - so it can't race EndOfLeds() on libDaisy's
 234:temp_led_stuff.h ****      *  shared static timhdma/globaltim (which used to let the ISR spin in
 235:temp_led_stuff.h ****      *  HAL_DMA_Init with a frozen tick and take the audio down with it). */
